# The error example used in the project review presentation. This file is
# written to be rejected: it exits 1.
#
#   line 14  a heading held in a variable, out of range. Only the optimiser's
#            constant propagation makes this visible to the range check.
#   line 17  a climb and a descent for the same aircraft with no 'advance'
#            between them: the first can never take effect.
scenario "Errors"

fix VOMAN 12.95 77.67
flight AI202 type A320 enter VOMAN alt FL240 hdg 090 spd 280KT

let turn = 450
clear AI202 heading turn

clear AI202 climb FL320
clear AI202 descend FL280
advance 60
